<section class="section-padding" style="background: var(--color-white);">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title">
      <h2>You Question, We Answer</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="faq-accordion" style="max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <details style="margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          Why is your Ghee so expensive?
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding-top: 15px; color: #666;">
          It takes 30 liters of A2 milk to make just 1 liter of our Bilona Ghee. We treat our cows as family, not as milk machines. Every jar is handcrafted with mantras and love.
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          What do "Forest Fed" cows eat?
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding-top: 15px; color: #666;">
          Our Kapila cows graze freely in the forest, feeding on medicinal herbs like Ashwagandha, Amruthaballi, and over 50 varieties of wild grasses and shrubs.
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          Is this made from Cream or Curd (Bilona)?
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding-top: 15px; color: #666;">
          We strictly use the Bilona method. Milk is boiled, turned into curd, hand-churned into butter, and then slow-heated. We NEVER use the industrial cream-to-butter method.
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details style="margin-bottom: 20px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 10px;">
        <summary style="font-weight: 700; font-family: var(--font-heading); font-size: 24px; cursor: pointer; list-style: none; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
          Can I use this for Ayurveda?
          <span class="icon">+</span>
        </summary>
        <div style="padding-top: 15px; color: #666;">
          Yes! Our Ghee is of medicinal grade and is highly recommended for Nasya, Netra Basti, and other Ayurvedic treatments due to its high potency and granular structure.
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "FAQ",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "FAQ"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
